      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this would be fine for now, but trying to look for some alternatives: do you happen to know if Android instantiates ICO decoders explicitly (`SkIcoDecoder`), or via generic `SkCodec::MakeFromStream`?  If the former, we could store (optional) PNG and BMP codec factories in the ICO codec and extend the `SkIcoDecoder` entry points.",
      "revId": "5d846b7f060558fd7a120d2f184e8f08e6c9d872",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
